Package: com.local.everynotifyvibe
Name: EveryNotifyVibe
Version: 0.6.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Forces every notification to vibrate for enabled apps, including repeated/grouped alerts that iOS 16 may normally deliver silently. Per-app switches let disabled apps use untouched stock iOS notification behaviour.
Maintainer: EveryNotifyVibe
Author: EveryNotifyVibe
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader, firmware (>= 15.0)
